             `null.toFixed()` is a CRASH, not a wrong number. Written inline rather
             than as a frontmatter const because index.astro's frontmatter is
             imports-only, and an indexer counter pins that. */
          REVIEW_SOURCE.rating !== null && (
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <Icon name="star" class="text-accent-amber text-card-title" />
              <span class="text-card-title font-black text-fg">
