  <!-- ─── Pita dekoratif Jepang (asanoha) ──────────────────────────────
       The ONE landingside gamefeel element that needs no visitor state.

       WHY THIS IS A BARE BAND AND NOT A LAYER INSIDE A Section. `Section`
       renders `py-14 md:py-20` with no `relative`, so an absolutely-positioned
       child would escape its box and paint over the section above it. A band
